               "text": "#### Writing to Suanpan\n\nThis is the first text in a series that teaches how to use the Suanpan (算盤). In this text you will represent numbers from 0 to 9. Work only with the first column from the right; later texts will use the whole abacus.\n\nThe markers on top (red) have value 5 each, and the markers below (blue) have value 1 each. Set the values requested in the yellow box near the 'Value' box.",
